g practices.\n\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\n\nThis vulnerability is related to [CWE-20: Improper Input Validation](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/20.html), which involves the incorrect validation of input data, leading to potential security issues.\n\nPlease ensure to verify the links and their accessibility as they may change over time."
