uick-reference-guide/): A quick reference guide for secure coding practices.\r\n\r\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\r\n\r\nThis vulnerability is related to the following CWE:\r\n\r\n- [CWE-20: Improper Input Validation](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/20.html)\r\n\r\nPlease ensure to verify the links for accessibility and validity as they are subject to change."
