es.\n\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\n\n- **CWE-20: Improper Input Validation**: This vulnerability is closely related to CWE-20, which involves the failure to properly validate input, leading to potential security issues.\n\nFor more detailed information on CWE-20, you can visit the [CWE website](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/20.html)."
