              "id": "glog-5c2ce375-45db-4fd2-910f-8986260b3c39",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "### Description\r\n\r\nCVE-2012-5077 is a vulnerability found in the Java Runtime Environment (JRE) component of Oracle Java SE. This vulnerability allows remote attackers to affect confidentiality, integrity, and availability via unknown vectors related to the Java Runtime Environment. It is a critical security issue that can be exploited to execute arbitrary code on the affected system.\r\n\r\n### General Mitigation Advice\r\n\r\n1. **Update Java**: Ensure that you are using the latest version of Java. Oracle regularly releases updates that patch known vulnerabilities.\r\n2. **Restrict Permissions**: Run Java applications with the least privileges necessary to limit the potential impact of an exploit.\r\n3. **Network Security**: Use firewalls and intrusion detection systems to monitor and block suspicious activities.\r\n4. **Disable Unnecessary Features**: Disable Java in web browsers if it is not required, as this is a common attack vector.\r\n5. **Security Tools**: Use security tools and software to detect and prevent exploitation attempts.\r\n\r\n### Source Code Fix Recommendation\r\n\r\nWhile the vulnerability is within the Java Runtime Environment itself and not directly in user code, developers should:\r\n\r\n- Avoid using deprecated or unsafe Java APIs.\r\n- Validate and sanitize all inputs to prevent injection attacks.\r\n- Use security libraries and frameworks that provide additional protection against common vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\n### Relevant OWASP Resources\r\n\r\n- [OWASP Top Ten](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\r\n\r\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\r\n\r\n- [CWE-20: Improper Input Validation](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/20.html)\r\n\r\nPlease ensure that you regularly check for updates and patches from Oracle and apply them promptly to mitigate potential risks associated with this vulnerability."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "CVE-2012-5077/suse:java:"
                ]
              }
